# dd Mon yyyy + HH:MM 解析（GP3：%b 依赖英文月份；locale 链式容错，失败计数不静默 NA）
dt_parse <- function(d, t) {
  old <- Sys.getlocale("LC_TIME"); on.exit(Sys.setlocale("LC_TIME", old))
  d <- trimws(as.character(d)); t <- trimws(as.character(t))
  ok <- !is.na(d) & d != "" & !is.na(t) & t != ""
  out <- as.POSIXct(rep(NA_character_, length(d)), tz = "UTC")
  for (lc in c("English", "en_US.UTF-8", "C")) {
    suppressWarnings(Sys.setlocale("LC_TIME", lc))
    if (any(ok)) {
      out[ok] <- suppressWarnings(as.POSIXct(paste(d, t)[ok],
                                             format = "%d %b %Y %H:%M", tz = "UTC"))
    }
    if (all(!ok | !is.na(out))) break
  }
  n_fail <- sum(ok & is.na(out))
  if (n_fail > 0) note("[QC] 日期时间解析失败 ", n_fail,
                       " 条（GP3 计数，相关行 RT 留空，请核对源数据）")
  out
}
# 半进位舍入（自带去噪版，不依赖运行环境包）
round_half_up <- function(x, digits = 0) {
  z <- abs(x) * 10^digits
  sign(x) * floor(z + 0.5 + sqrt(.Machine$double.eps)) / 10^digits
}
# 浓度=6 位有效数字文本（首位非零起算，不足位补零；非科学计数；逐元素实现——
# 向量版 format() 会整列统一格式补出 7 位；是否采用由 Z6 按项目口径实证决定）
sig6 <- function(x) {
  vapply(as.numeric(x), function(v) {
    if (is.na(v)) return(NA_character_)
    d <- 6 - floor(log10(abs(v))) - 1
    if (!is.finite(d) || d < 0) d <- 6
    sprintf(paste0("%.", d, "f"), v)
  }, character(1))
}
norm_char <- function(x) {
  x <- trimws(as.character(x))
  num <- suppressWarnings(as.numeric(x))
  ok <- !is.na(num) & !is.na(x) & x != ""
  x[ok] <- trimws(formatC(num[ok], format = "fg", digits = 15))
  x
}
fasted_fed <- function(x) case_when(
  toupper(x) == "FASTED" ~ "Fasted", toupper(x) == "FED" ~ "Fed", TRUE ~ NA_character_)
# 值域出路（GP0）：值域外时点/访视被过滤时点名告警，不静默
